# Naming Conventions

## File Naming

**Next.js App Router**:
```
app/
├── layout.tsx           # Root layout
├── page.tsx             # Home page
├── loading.tsx          # Loading UI
├── error.tsx            # Error boundary
├── posts/
│   ├── page.tsx         # /posts route
│   ├── components/      # Page-specific
│   │   └── posts-list.tsx
│   └── hooks/
│       └── use-posts.ts
```

**Components**: `kebab-case.tsx`
- `posts-list.tsx`
- `theme-toggle.tsx`
- `user-profile.tsx`

**Hooks**: `use-*.ts`
- `use-posts.ts`
- `use-error-handler.ts`
- `use-auth.ts`

**Utilities**: `kebab-case.ts`
- `logger.ts`
- `error-tracker.tsx`
- `date-utils.ts`

## Import Conventions

```typescript
// 1. External dependencies
import { z } from "zod";
import { createTRPCRouter } from "@trpc/server";

// 2. Workspace packages
import { posts } from "@repo/db/schema";
import { Button } from "@repo/ui";

// 3. Relative imports
import { publicProcedure } from "~/server/trpc";
import { logger } from "~/shared/lib/logger";
import type { Post } from "~/types";
```

## Barrel Exports

```typescript
// ✅ Use barrel exports
// shared/lib/index.ts
export * from "./logger";
export * from "./error-tracker";

// Usage
import { logger, defaultErrorTracker } from "~/shared/lib";
```

## Variable Naming

```typescript
// ✅ Descriptive names
const userEmail = "user@example.com";
const isLoading = true;
const handleSubmit = () => { };

// ✅ Boolean prefixes
const isActive = true;
const hasPermission = false;
const canDelete = true;

// ✅ Constants
const MAX_RETRIES = 3;
const API_TIMEOUT = 5000;
```

## Avoid

- ❌ Default exports (except Next.js pages)
- ❌ Single letter variables (except loop counters)
- ❌ Abbreviations (unless standard: `id`, `url`, `api`)
